LICENCE FOR THE DATA IN THIS FOLDER
===================================

The code in this repository (scripts/, notebooks/) is MIT-licensed — see the LICENSE
file at the repository root. The DATA in this folder is not: it is derived from third-
party corpora and carries their licences instead. That is the whole reason this
separate file exists.

Full provenance, notes and citations: ../SOURCES.md


Per-file licences
-----------------

raamove_demo.json
    Derived from RAAMove (Liu et al., LREC-COLING 2024).
    Licence: CREATIVE COMMONS ATTRIBUTION 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

cars50_demo.json
    Derived from CaRS-50 (Lam & Nnamoko, 2025), Mendeley Data V1,
    doi:10.17632/kwr9s5c4nk.1.
    Licence: CREATIVE COMMONS ATTRIBUTION 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

l2_errors_demo.json
    Derived from AutoErrorAnalyzer (Mizumoto, 2025, Studies in Second Language
    Acquisition 47(3)), OSF project jyf3r.
    Licence: CREATIVE COMMONS ATTRIBUTION 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/


All of the above have been RESHAPED from their original formats into this course's
canonical schema, [{"id", "text", "label"}], and in most cases sub-sampled. They are
not the original distributions. Cite the original source, and say that the data were
reshaped.


NOT IN THIS FOLDER, AND NOT REDISTRIBUTABLE
-------------------------------------------

ICNALE GRA (Ishikawa) is available for research use only, via registration, and may
NOT be redistributed. No ICNALE-derived file may be committed to this repository or
included in a submission bundle. Both .gitignore and scripts/make_submission.py
exclude it by name — please do not work around them.
